<parameter name="content"># Crisis Compass Cleanup

## What to Remove for GitHub Pages

### Essential Files (KEEP ✅)
- `index.html` - Main page
- `styles.css` - Styles
- `scripts.js` - JavaScript
- `resources.json` - Service data
- `privacy.html` - Privacy policy
- `i18n/` - Translations
- `README.md` - Documentation
- `.git/` - Git repository
- `.gitignore` - Git ignore rules

### Remove These Files
```bash
# Development files
rm .eslintrc.js
rm package.json
rm package-lock.json

# Test files
rm test_all_features.py
rm test-api.sh
rm test-functions.js

# Documentation (keep only README.md)
rm FEATURE_TEST_PLAN.md
rm GET_ALL_50_STATES_QUICK_START.md
rm IMPROVEMENTS_PLAN.md
rm LOCATION_FEATURES_SUMMARY.md
rm LOCATION_FEATURES.md
rm LOCATION_QUICK_REFERENCE.md
rm NATIONAL_DATA_INTEGRATION.md
rm NATIONAL_EXPANSION_ROADMAP.md
rm WEBSITE_TEST_PLAN.md
rm TEST_REPORT.md
rm TEST_RESULTS.json
rm TODO.md
rm cleanup.sh
rm CLEANUP.md

# Directories
rm -rf .vscode/
rm -rf node_modules/
rm -rf backend/
rm -rf docs/
```

